                <invention-title lang="de">PAPIERBECHER UND VERFAHREN ZU SEINER HERSTELLUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">GOBELET EN PAPIER ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE FORMATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PAPER CUP AND METHOD OF FORMING THE SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A paper cup and a method of forming the same. The paper cup may include a sidewall and a floor portion that collectively define a cavity. In one aspect, the paper cup may include a rim that is coated with a rigid shell that encapsulates the rim. In another aspect, a void defined by a rim of the paper cup may be filled with a rigid filler material, and the rigid filler material may be one that expands upon application of heat thereto. In yet another aspect, the paper cup may include a separate rim component that is attached to the sidewall. The separate rim component may be formed from moulded pulp fibres, and it may include a flange portion that is attached to the sidewall and a rim portion that protrudes from the sidewall.</p>
            </abstract>
